      'In San Antonio, three-coat cement stucco installation runs $8 to $15 per square foot of wall surface. Using the typical 1,200 to 1,500 square feet of wall surface on a 1,000 square foot home, the total cost falls between roughly $10,000 and $22,000. Most 1,000 square foot homes land in the $10,000 to $19,000 range because they are single-story with standard wall heights and moderate complexity.',
